        - Output: :math:`(*)`. Output is of the same shape as input

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.AlphaDropout(p=0.2)
        >>> input = torch.randn(20, 16)
        >>> output = m(input)

    .. _Self-Normalizing Neural Networks: https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.02515

